  "subtitle": "Capture conference agenda, student work, attendance context, and family question; confirm agreed action and progress follow-up.",
  "description": "Parent Conference records conference agenda, student work, attendance context, family question, agreed action, and progress follow-up. Parent Conference evidence stays linked.",
  "use_case": "Use this parent conference time-ordered tracking when staff must document conference agenda and student work. Reconcile attendance context, family question, agreed action, and progress follow-up before the parent conference handoff. Use the conference invitation, work samples, gradebook snapshot, attendance record, teacher observations, family questions, action notes, and progress-review calendar. For parent conference live use, check roster. Reconcile the parent conference schedule and actual handoff times. Preserve the parent conference roster and schedule. Record the parent conference handoff time and instructions. Close the parent conference exception queue. Verify parent conference day-of-service timing. Resolve parent conference real-time changes and operating handoff for parent conference. Ask the assigned parent conference reviewer to confirm conference agenda against the organization's policy.",
  "risk_tier": "B",
